@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram (Business Process Outsourcing Bpo Management System)

[*] --> UserType

state UserType <<choice>>
UserType --> Registration : [New user]
UserType --> Login : [Registered user]

Login --> ManageProfile : [Successful login]
Registration --> SaveInfo : [Successful registration]

ManageProfile --> EditDetails : [Edit details]
ManageProfile --> UploadRequest : [Upload request]
ManageProfile --> SearchUsers : [Search users]
ManageProfile --> CurrentDeals : [View current deals]
ManageProfile --> Logout : [Log out]

EditDetails --> ChangePassword : [Change password]
EditDetails --> ValidateInfo : [Validate information]
EditDetails --> SaveChanges : [Save changes]

UploadRequest --> SaveProject : [Save project details]
UploadRequest --> SearchCategory : [Search for suitable project category]

SearchUsers --> MatchingUsers : [Display matching users based on chosen criteria]

SaveProject --> AcceptRequest : [Accept request from client]
SaveProject --> DeclineRequest : [Decline request from client]

AcceptRequest --> Proceed : [Client decides to proceed with accepted project]
AcceptRequest --> Reject : [Client rejects the accepted project]

Proceed --> UpdateStatus : [Update project status after acceptance by both parties]
Reject --> RestartProcess : [Restart the process if a client is unsatisfied with the final project]

UpdateStatus --> TrackProgress : [Allow a client to track the progress of a project]
UpdateStatus --> UpdateProgress : [Enable an BPO organization to update the progress of a project]

TrackProgress --> FinalProject : [Upload a final project once work is completed]
FinalProject --> QualityCheck : [Perform a quality check on the final project]
FinalProject --> MakePayment : [Make payment if the client is satisfied with the final project]
@enduml
